  "hypothesis": "Stocks in an uptrend that break their 20-day high on above-average volume, while outperforming NIFTY, tend to continue for a few weeks. Only trade when the index itself is in an uptrend.",
  "rules": {
   "score": [
    "+2 price > 50-day SMA > 200-day SMA (uptrend); -2 if the reverse",
